    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30026" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγυμν-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exercise in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ψυχὴν θεάμασιν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Salt.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γνώμην ἐνθυμήμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					3
				</span></i>
